<p>Call upon the battlefields of old, collecting bones, fusing them with souls, and forging them into skeletal minions.</p><p>Up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> skeleton warriors of level <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>character level 50">44, 46, 48, 50, 52</acronym> are summoned, and up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> skeletons can be controlled at once.</p><p>At level 3 the summons become armoured skeletons warriors.</p><p>At level 5, for every 3 skeleton warriors, a skeleton mage or archer will also be created without costing any souls. If this makes you go over your skeleton limit, a normal skeleton will be removed and its soul refunded.</p><p></p><p><span style="color: #7f7f7f"><span class="tstr-color-GREY"><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Skeleton minions come in fewer numbers than ghoul minions but are generally more durable.</span></span></p><p></p>